              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Utilize UTM parameters in URLs accurately track, differentiate leads from Google Ads versus organic traffic. This involves creating invisible form fields on landing pages capture UTM data.",
