          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Optimizing Google Ads campaigns through strategic keyword research, management, including implementation of negative keywords, is essential for improving ad performance, cost-efficiency. This ensures ads are shown to relevant audiences while minimizing irrelevant clicks.",
