              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Need for effective keyword research and management to reduce costs, improve ad performance, avoid unwanted clicks. This involves continuous monitoring and updating keyword strategies.",
